flowchart TD
  Req[Request arrives with auth type] --> HasId{Has Entra identity?}
  HasId -->|No: Shared Key or service SAS| KeyPath[Authorize by key or SAS only]
  HasId -->|Yes: Entra or user-delegated SAS| RBAC{Data role grants access?}
  RBAC -->|No role| Deny[Deny]
  RBAC -->|Owner-level role| Allow[Allow: superuser bypasses ACL]
  RBAC -->|Reader or Contributor| ACL{ACL allows on target plus X on all parents?}
  ACL -->|Yes| Allow2[Allow]
  ACL -->|No| Deny2[Deny]
